Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: `Iter` has no method `nth`
  --> tests/ui/iter_missing_method_hint.jet:7:14
    |
  7 |     _: parts.nth(1)
    |              ^^^
 Why: Positional picks on `Iter` use one consuming path
 Fix: Use `.skip(n).first()`; `nth` is not part of the API
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102

Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: `Iter` has no method `get`
  --> tests/ui/iter_missing_method_hint.jet:8:14
    |
  8 |     _: parts.get(0)
    |              ^^^
 Why: `Iter` is a one-pass source; `get` needs a materialized list, so collection consumes the source and allocates the list
 Fix: Materialize it first with `.to_list()`; this consumes the source and allocates a list
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102

